{"id":72991,"date":"2026-11-07T06:51:28","date_gmt":"2026-11-07T06:51:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72991"},"modified":"2026-11-07T07:54:25","modified_gmt":"2026-11-07T06:54:25","slug":"limestone-ultra-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/limestone-ultra-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Limestone Ultra Trail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Limestone Ultra Trail 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Limestone Ultra Trail 2027<\/strong> (LUT \u2014 7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se de <strong>29 a 31 de julho de 2027<\/strong>, com centro nevr\u00e1lgico e secretariado instalados no complexo das <strong>Grutas de Mira de Aire<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Porto de M\u00f3s<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Certificado pela <strong>ITRA<\/strong>, <strong>UTMB World Series Index<\/strong> e <strong>Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (FPA)<\/strong> \u2014 integrando ainda o Circuito Latitude 37-40 e a ADAL \u2014, o evento desafia os atletas nos trilhos t\u00e9cnicos do maci\u00e7o c\u00e1rsico das Serras de Aire e Candeeiros.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa competitivo compreende seis dist\u00e2ncias principais com pontua\u00e7\u00e3o ITRA e indexa\u00e7\u00e3o UTMB: o <strong>LUT 100M (167 km e +9.252 m D+)<\/strong> com partida na quinta-feira (29 de julho) \u00e0s 22h00 e limite de 45 horas; o <strong>LUT 100K (108 km e +6.128 m D+)<\/strong> na sexta-feira (30 de julho) \u00e0s 21h00 (limite de 26 horas); e, no s\u00e1bado (31 de julho), o <strong>LUT 60K (63 km e +2.918 m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 08h00, o <strong>LUT 30K (34 km e +1.793 m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 16h30, o <strong>LUT 20K (20 km e +893 m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 17h30 e o <strong>LUT 15K (15 km e +618 m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 18h30, al\u00e9m do <strong>LUT Kids (1 km a 3 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h30 e da caminhada <strong>LUT DayWalk<\/strong> \u00e0s 18h30.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em tr\u00eas fases entre 1 de novembro de 2026 e 25 de julho de 2027 e incluem peitoral personalizado com chip, geolocalizador GPS (nas provas LUT 100M e LUT 100K), abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, transporte para a partida, pr\u00e9mio finisher, refei\u00e7\u00e3o, seguro desportivo e cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios no s\u00e1bado \u00e0s 20h30. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -we