#94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 de Julho de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase (01\/11\/2026 a 05\/01\/2027):<\/strong> 5,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase (06\/01\/2027 a 30\/04\/2027):<\/strong> 8,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase (01\/05\/2027 a 25\/07\/2027):<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Limestone Ultra Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Limestone Ultra Trail (LUT) realiza-se de 29 a 31 de julho de 2027, com arena e secretariado no complexo das Grutas de Mira de Aire, no concelho de Porto de M\u00f3s (distrito de Leiria).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O LUT 100M (167 km, +9.252 m D+) parte a 29 de julho \u00e0s 22h00; o LUT 100K (108 km, +6.128 m D+) parte a 30 de julho \u00e0s 21h00; e no s\u00e1bado, 31 de julho, partem o LUT 60K (63 km, +2.918 m D+) \u00e0s 08h00, LUT Kids (1 a 3 km) \u00e0s 09h30, LUT 30K (34 km, +1.793 m D+) \u00e0s 16h30, LUT 20K (20 km, +893 m D+) \u00e0s 17h30 e LUT 15K (15 km, +618 m D+) e DayWalk \u00e0s 18h30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do LUT 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em 3 fases (at\u00e9 5 de janeiro, at\u00e9 30 de abril e at\u00e9 25 de julho de 2027): LUT 100M (120 \u20ac \/ 150 \u20ac \/ 180 \u20ac), LUT 100K (85 \u20ac \/ 100 \u20ac \/ 120 \u20ac), LUT 60K (55 \u20ac \/ 65 \u20ac \/ 75 \u20ac), LUT 30K (30 \u20ac \/ 45 \u20ac \/ 55 \u20ac), LUT 20K (20 \u20ac \/ 25 \u20ac \/ 30 \u20ac), LUT 15K (18 \u20ac \/ 20 \u20ac \/ 25 \u20ac), DayWalk (15 \u20ac \/ 18 \u20ac \/ 20 \u20ac) e LUT Kids (5 \u20ac \/ 8 \u20ac \/ 10 \u20ac).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que certifica\u00e7\u00f5es e pontos ITRA \/ UTMB atribui a prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 certificado pela ITRA, UTMB World Series Index e FPA, atribuindo 6 pontos ITRA (Cat. 100M) nos 167 km, 5 pontos ITRA (Cat. 100K) nos 108 km, 3 pontos ITRA (Cat. 50K) nos 63 km, 2 pontos ITRA (Cat. 20K) nos 34 km e 1 ponto ITRA (Cat. 20K) nos 20 km.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e a lista de material obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial completo da 7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o (incluindo tabela de material obrigat\u00f3rio para cada dist\u00e2ncia e tempos limite) pode ser descarregado em PDF no bot\u00e3o de regulamento desta p\u00e1gina.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Limestone Ultra Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-07-29\", \"endDate\": \"2027-07-29\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEv